OL,3,GNEWSANew busway fencing 'a wall you
OL,4,Acan't see past'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewly installed safety fencing will be
OL,7,Freplaced at some crossing points along
OL,8,FCambridgeshire's guided busway,
OL,9,Ffollowing complaints it had created "a
OL,10,Fwall you can't see past".
OL,12,FThe county council has been installing
OL,13,Fmetal barriers along much of the
OL,14,F16-mile (26km) route, after three
OL,15,Fpeople were struck and killed by buses
OL,16,Fon the network.
OL,18,FPeople in Trumpington told the BBC that
OL,19,Fnew 4ft 11in (1.5m) railings had
OL,20,Freduced visibility when crossing, with
OL,21,Fone calling it an "accident waiting to
OL,22,Fhappen".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
