OL,3,GNEWSANew busway fencing 'a wall you
OL,4,Acan't see past'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said officers had examined
OL,7,Ftwo crossings and deemed them "safe to
OL,8,Fuse", but the yellow fencing would be
OL,9,Freplaced with new panels "that have
OL,10,Fdifferent spacings and provide a more
OL,11,Fopen view".
